    <div id="root" class="contents"><div class="min-h-screen bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-indigo-100"><div class="container mx-auto px-4 py-16"><div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center"><h1 class="text-5xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Probate Made Easy</h1><p class="text-xl text-gray-700 mb-8">Complete your probate process with confidence. We guide you through the entire process and handle the legal documentation for you.</p><div class="rounded-xl border text-card-foreground shadow bg-white p-8 mb-8"><h2 class="text-2xl font-semibold text-gray-900 mb-6">How It Works</h2><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 text-left"><div><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 font-bold">1</div><h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Answer Questions</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Tell us about the deceased and provide your basic information</p></div><div><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 font-bold">2</div><h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Get Your Forms</h3><p class="text-gray-600">We retrieve legal forms from your county clerk at no charge</p></div><div><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 font-bold">3</div><h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Manage Heirs</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Add heirs and manage objections during the probate process</p></div><div><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 font-bold">4</div><h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">Publish &amp; Escrow</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Publish court notices and set up property escrow accounts</p></div><div><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 font-bold">5</div><h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">File with Court</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Submit probate documents and receive verification receipts</p></div><div><div class="w-12 h-12 bg-blue-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mb-4 font-bold">6</div><h3 class="font-semibold text-lg mb-2">House Occupancy</h3><p class="text-gray-600">Get permits to occupy and manage the probate property</p></div></div></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4 mb-8"><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 shadow h-9 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white px-6 py-4">Start Probate Process</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 shadow h-9 bg-green-600 hover:bg-green-700 text-white px-6 py-4">Track Case Status</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 shadow h-9 bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white px-6 py-4">Court Filing</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 shadow h-9 bg-purple-600 hover:bg-purple-700 text-white px-6 py-4">Find Properties</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 shadow h-9 bg-teal-600 hover:bg-teal-700 text-white px-6 py-4">Deceased Properties</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 shadow h-9 bg-orange-600 hover:bg-orange-700 text-white px-6 py-4">View Timeline</button><button class="inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap rounded-md text-sm font-medium transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 shadow h-9 bg-amber-600 hover:bg-amber-700 text-white px-6 py-4">Address Probate Lookup</button></div></div></div></div></div>
    
  


